       _l_i_b_c_r_y_p_t_o and the provider in OOSSSSLL__DDIISSPPAATTCCHH(3) arrays via
       OOSSSSLL__AALLGGOORRIITTHHMM(3) arrays that are returned by the provider’s
       pprroovviiddeerr__qquueerryy__ooppeerraattiioonn(()) function (see "Provider Functions" in
